Modifications from the upstream version:

- Removed the empty trailing `private:` section, which upstream keeps after the
  last pure virtual function.
- Zero-initialized the `Feedback` fields that upstream leaves uninitialized
  (`error_id`, `position`, `velocity`, `omega`, `torque`, `temp`), so that a
  default-constructed or partially filled feedback value is well defined.
- Changed the Module id in the README from `QDU-Robomaster/Motor` to
  `starpang888/Motor`.
